  WrittenDialogue: "Can’t believe I let this old guy talk me in to going to church.\nNot that I have a problem with Christianity it’s just very unsexy.\nI don’t wanna think about Jesus when I’m making out with a guy.\nIf Jesus sees everything he’s debilitated pervert.\nHe just watches people fuck while he’s in the corner with a Steve Buscemi smile.\nThis is why I’m bad at being religious.\nAlright Kelly let’s review some bible verses, eh?"
